.TH sway-things-hook-new-display 1 "" "Sway Things 0.5.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-hook\-new\-display \- Ask once whether a display plugged in to a combination set up on the Displays page shows the same picture or extends the desktop, and remember the answer: run by kanshi when one display more than such a combination is connected
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things hook new\-display\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ask once whether a display plugged in to a combination set up on the Displays page shows the same picture or extends the desktop, and remember the answer: run by kanshi when one display more than such a combination is connected
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
